OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife                
OL,5,CToday:FA cold start with a widespread  
OL,6,Ffrost. Then it will be largely dry and 
OL,7,Fcold day with plenty of sunshine.      
OL,8,FChance of a light shower along the     
OL,9,FAngus later.                           
OL,11,CTonight:FA mainly dry evening and      
OL,12,Fnight with clear periods. Clouding     
OL,13,Fover at times with the odd light       
OL,14,Fshower across the east. A cold night   
OL,15,Fwith patchy frost.                     
OL,17,CSunday:FMainly dry and cold with       
OL,18,Fbright or sunny spells. Chance of a    
OL,19,Flight shower in the north.             
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
