OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife                
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FDry   
OL,6,Fand bright on Monday. Chance of rain   
OL,7,Fat times on Tuesday and Wednesday.     
OL,8,FFresh southeasterly wind.              
